n:0%_0%] [background-size:auto_auto] [background-repeat:repeat] [background-origin:padding-box] [background-clip:border-box] [background-attachment:scroll] bg-site-import-muted border-0 rounded-[2px] text-[#555555] cursor-pointer text-[16px] font-semibold h-[44px]\">Filter</button></div><div class=\"h-[calc(100%_-_256px)] overflow-auto p-[12px]\" aria-label=\"Reviews list\"><div class=\"py-[14px] px-0 [border-bottom:1px_solid_rgb(239,239,239)]\"><div class=\"text-[#f4b400] text-[18px] tracking-[2px] mb-[8px]\">★★★★★</div><div class=\"text-[#222222] text-[16px] mb-[4px]\"><strong>Refilwe</strong> - 09 Aug 2021</div><div class=\"text-[#888888] text-[14px] italic mb-[10px]\">(Reviewed on day of purchase)</div><div class=\"text-[#333333] text-[15px] leading-[1.45]\">This combo is exactly what I needed for my new place. The microwave is roomy, the air fryer cooks chips perfectly crispy without oil, and the glass kettle boils in under two minutes. Amazing value for three appliances.</div></div><div class=\"py-[14px] px-0 [border-bottom:1px_solid_rgb(239,239,239)]\"><div class=\"text-[#f4b400] text-[18px] tracking-[2px] mb-[8px]\">★★★★★</div><div class=\"text-[#222222] text-[16px] mb-[4px]\"><strong>Nomsa Mkhize</strong> - 27 Sep 2021</div><div class=\"text-[#888888] text-[14px] italic mb-[10px]\">(Reviewed 15 days after purchase)</div><div class=\"text-[#333333] text-[15px] leading-[1.45]\">Don't wait. Perfect.<br><br>One of the best buys I've made. The air fryer has replaced my oven for most meals, the microwave heats evenly, and the kettle with the blue light looks beautiful on the counter. Highly recommended for anyone setting up a kitchen.</div></div><div class=\"py-[14px] px-0 [border-bottom:1px_solid_rgb(239,239,239)]\"><div class=\"text-[#f4b400] text-[18px] tracking-[2px] mb-[8px]\">★★★★★</div><div class=\"text-[#222222] text-[16px] mb-[4px]\"><strong>Robynn</strong> - 29 May 2023</div><div class=\"text-[#888888] text-[14px] italic mb-[10px]\">(Reviewed 7 days after purchase)</div><div class=\"text-[#333333] text-[15px] leading-[1.45]\">Perfect, ideal for a family kitchen<br><br>Very good quality appliances. Buying the microwave, air fryer and kettle together saved me a lot of money, and they all match so the kitchen looks tidy. Great value for a complete bundle.</div></div><div class=\"py-[14px] px-0 [border-bottom:1px_solid_rgb(239,239,239)]\"><div class=\"text-[#f4b400] text-[18px] tracking-[2px] mb-[8px]\">★★★★★</div><div class=\"text-[#222222] text-[16px] mb-[4px]\"><strong>Lize</strong> - 26 Jun 2023</div><div class=\"text-[#888888] text-[14px] italic mb-[10px]\">(Reviewed 14 days after purchase)</div><div class=\"text-[#333333] text-[15px] leading-[1.45]\">I really like this combo. Everything is simple to use and does exactly what it promises. The air fryer for supper and the kettle for morning coffee have become part of my daily routine. Great results.</div></div></div></div>",
    "text": "←\nDefy 30L MW + RH Air Fryer...\n4.6\n★★★★★\n3564 Reviews\n5 ★\n2624\n4 ★\n685\n3 ★\n104\n2 ★\n40\n1 ★\n111\nWrite Review\nSort\nFilter\n★★★★★\nRefilwe - 09 Aug 2021\n(Reviewed on day of purchase)\nThis combo is exactly what I needed for my new place. The microwave is roomy, the air fryer cooks chips perfectly crispy without oil, and the glass kettle boils in under two minutes. Amazing value for three appliances.\n★★★★★\nNomsa Mkhize - 27 Sep 2021\n(Reviewed 15 days after purchase)\nDon't wait. Perfect.\n\nOne of the best buys I've made. The air fryer has replaced my oven for most meals, the microwave heats evenly, and the kettle with the blue light looks beautiful on the counter. Highly recommended for anyone setting up a kitchen.\n★★★★★\nRobynn - 29 May 2023\n(Reviewed 7 days after purchase)\nPerfect, ideal for a family kitchen\n\nVery good quality appliances. Buying the microwave, air fryer and kettle together saved me a lot of money, and they all match so the kitchen looks tidy. Great value for a complete bundle.\n★★★★★\nLize - 26 Jun 2023\n(Reviewed 14 days after purchase)\nI really like this combo. Everything is simple to use and does exactly what it promises. The air fryer for supper and the kettle for morning coffee have become part of my daily routine. Great results.",
